["A Spoonful of Sugar"]={description="Using the key ingredient you and Lilisette have laboriously acquired, Amaura was finally able to concoct the same medicine that Sir Ragelise used all those years ago. Deliver it to the ailing knight at the Chateau d'Oraguille without delay.",id=10,next={"Affairs of State"},previous={"Daughter of a Knight"},start_npc="Southern San d'Oria (S)",start_zone="Southern San d'Oria"},
