["Lest We Forget"]={description="Mission Orders: So it was that Altana's grief was ended, tears marring Her divine countenance no more. Yet the Crystal War rages on. Ever must you carry on the fight, in honor of she who sacrificed all, that others might know peace...",id=53,previous={"A Token of Troth"},start_pos="F-5",title="Champion of the Dawn"},
